// Cyberbane - Retired file. Empty on purpose: do not delete it.
//
// Installing a new version over an old one does not remove files, so the old copy stayed on every install that updated
// by hand, and went on being compiled. This file exists so that installing over the top replaces the old copy.
// tools/check_removed.ps1 fails the build if a script the mod has ever shipped goes missing.

public func CBRetiredVanillaChase() -> Bool = false
